epository.get\", \"type\": \"calls\"},\n    {\"from\": \"minisvc.storage.repo:OrderRepository\", \"to\": \"SQLite database_path\", \"type\": \"persists_to\"},\n    {\"from\": \"minisvc.api.handlers:create_order\", \"to\": \"minisvc.audit:order_event\", \"type\": \"calls\"},\n    {\"from\": \"minisvc.api.handlers:get_order\", \"to\": \"minisvc.audit:order_event\", \"type\": \"calls\"}\n  ],\n  \"key_functions\": [\n    {\"name\": \"minisvc.cli:main\", \"role\": \"Loads environment settings, creates OrderRepository, initializes orders table, and returns 0.\"},\n    {\"name\": \"minisvc.config:load_settings\", \"role\": \"Reads MINISVC_DB (default orders.sqlite) and MINISVC_READONLY (only records a boolean).\"},\n    {\"name\": \"minisvc.api.routes:register_routes\", \"role\": \"Binds POST /orders and GET /orders/<order_id> callbacks.\"},\n    {\"name\": \"minisvc.api.handlers:create_order\", \"role\": \"Indexes required payload fields, casts total_cents to int, saves the Order, and returns a created response.\"},\n    {\"name\": \"minisvc.api.handlers:get_order\", \"role\": \"Looks up an order and returns either missing or serialized order data plus a read event.\"},\n    {\"name\": \"minisvc.storage.repo:OrderRepository.save\", \"role\": \"Inserts one order with parameterized SQL in a SQLite transaction.\"},\n    {\"name\": \"minisvc.storage.repo:OrderRepository.get\", \"role\": \"Queries one order by ID and reconstructs Order(*row).\"},\n    {\"name\": \"minisvc.audit:order_event\", \"role\": \"Returns an event dict; no database or file write occurs.\"}\n  ],\n  \"runtime_flows\": [\n    {\"name\": \"CLI startup\", \"steps\": [\"console script dispatches to minisvc.cli:main\", \"main passes os.environ to config.load_settings\", \"main instantiates OrderRepository(settings.database_path)\", \"repo.init_schema creates orders table if absent\", \"main prints readiness and returns 0\"]},\n    {\"name\": \"HTTP create-order\", \"steps\": [\"HTTP adapter invokes route cal